# Mernify core

## Stack

- React 19 + Vite 7 SPA; Cloudflare Pages; Pages Functions under `functions/`
- Optional AI chat Worker: `cf-worker/ai-chat.js`
- Content-driven pages from `src/content/`

## Brand

- Indigo `#4f46e5`, cyan `#15c6e2`
- Tagline: “Build Modern. Scale Confidently.”
- Contact: `info@mernify.co`
- Preserve existing layout/motion; do not redesign working UI unless asked

## Secrets

- Never use `VITE_*` for secrets (`EMAIL_SECRET`, Resend, etc.)
- Never commit `.env`, `.env.local`, `cf-worker/.dev.vars`
- Prefer `.env.example` / `.dev.vars.example` with placeholders only

## Email

- Contact + newsletter → same-origin APIs → mail microservice (`EMAIL_SERVICE_URL` + `EMAIL_SECRET`)
- Do not return fake success without a real provider
- Prefer microservice path over Resend/Contact Worker unless the user explicitly changes direction

## Deploy

- Deploy from **repo root** so `functions/` is included
- Production docs: `deploy/PAGES_GO_LIVE.md`, `deploy/DEPLOY.md`

## Git

- Commit only when the user asks
- Do not force-push or rewrite shared history
